It has now been pointed at one public leaderboard of the shape it was built for: a preregistered disjoint-field deployment (\S\ref{sec:ajb}) whose six judges and five contestants share no members returns a refusal on all 3,200 boards and certifies none, because the judge pool's best member aligns with the external ruler better than the contestant field's best member does. So the $\mathrm{READABLE}$ arm of \eqref{eq:rule} still fires only on the test suite's positive control, and a positive wild reading is the next measurement, not a finding of this paper. A preregistered calibrated variant of the floor does return certifications on the released panel --- the corrected rule certifies on 1,242 of 9,568 measurable resampled boards where the uncorrected rule certifies on none, and on the configurations that leave a true external margin the false-certification rate is between 0.000 and 0.069 --- but the certified quantity is the variant's own debiased alignment (\S\ref{sec:calibrated}), on a pool whose contestants are its judges. % 参考文献：本稿引用的每一条都经外部核验（元数据来自 Crossref/OpenAlex/arXiv % 返回值，不凭记忆补写），核验过程与未核验清单见 notes_refs.md；2026-10-11 % 追加的 7 条（Goodhart 1984 / Hennessy-Goodhart 2023 / Bradley-Terry 1952 / % Chatbot Arena 2403.04132 / RLHF 2203.02155 / DPO 2305.18290 / Campbell 2011）同样 % 逐条核验，其中 Goodhart 1975 Courakis 版、Strathern 1997 note 7、Elo 1978 原书、 % Campbell 1976 章节形态检索不到可索引记录，一律不写，只作为不可引记录留在 % refs.bib 的 F 段注释与 notes_refs.md 里。 % 少数条目（Fleiss 1971 的题名、Gilson 等 ChatGPT-as-annotator 的检索失败、 % Surech 等 "good-enough" 标注者数量的说法）在核验中未通过，因此正文不引。 % 参考文献手写而非 \bibliography{refs}：refs.bib 每条都带一句中文 % 「本条支撑本文哪句话」的注释，若用 bibtex + plain 样式，note 字段会被排进 % 参考文献列表，中文在 pdflatex 下无法编译；手写 thebibliography 让那些注释 % 留在 .bib 里（核验记录另见 notes_refs.md），正文只出现英文字段。
